"The guest sees this time.":883,[u.lo]:884,[u.as]:885,[u.gQ]:886,"The month the account opens is free. The next month is used and paid on its last day. Not paid = blocked on the 1st. Proof sent = open 72 hours while you check. Confirmed = open to the end of the next month. Owners on a commission agreement are on the Commission list and are never blocked automatically.":887,"The other side must accept before it applies.":888,[u.mF]:889,"The owner gets an alert with this short reason, their percentage and what is missing. After that they get a reminder every 24 hours (they can switch it off).":890,"The owner must already have a NamStay account (Create account in the app). Then fill in the place for them.":891,[u.mT]:892,"The person must first create a NamStay account (Create account). Then type their number here.":893,"The proof is a file (PDF). Open the booking on a computer.":894,"The room cannot be used until it is fixed":895,"The room is already fully paid.":896,"The same agreed amount every month, however many guests come.":897,[u.jK]:898,"The stay is now complimentary":899,"The tour link must start with https://":900,"The two PINs are not the same":901,"The two new passwords are not the same":902,"Their phone number":903,[u.jZ]:904,"These details are printed on the invoices guests download.":905,"They are on a separate list (Commission tab) and are never blocked automatically. Tap for this month's commission.":906,"They are removed for good.":907,"They get a WhatsApp message. If they already use NamStay (even as a guest), the invite also appears in their app.":908,[u.lp]:909,[u.jM]:910,"This account is protected.":911,"This device":912,"This device is already the shared front desk of":913,"This device is now the shared front desk":914,"This device is the shared front desk":915,"This guest booked through NamStay (commission agreement): talk to the guest in Messages below.":916,'This guest has no NamStay account (walk-in). Use "Download or share" to send it by WhatsApp or email.':917,"This guest has no phone number, so the bill cannot be reported.":918,[u.p1]:919,[u.X]:920,"This removes the person, their guesthouses (if any), rooms, bookings and history. It cannot be undone.":921,"This room has":922,"Those owners are blocked now. Check the payments today.":923,"Those owners are blocked. Check the payment today, then confirm or call the client.":924,"Times saved":925,'Tip: open a guest complaint and tap "Give to employee" to turn it into a task.':926,[u.cm]:927,"To check":928,"To do":929,"To pay":930,"To protect you from fraud, after saving only NamStay Billing can change them, after checking the request.":931,Today:932,Total:933,"Total received":934,Town:935,"Town information":936,Traveller:937,"Travellers tap the room to see them. The first photo is the main one.":938,"Travellers will not be able to book this owner's places. Nothing is deleted: bookings, invoices and payments stay.":939,"Trip finished. We hope you enjoyed it!":940,"Turn off the shared device?":941,"Turn on two-step login":942,"Two-step login for the team":943,"Two-step login is on":944,Type:945,"Type a name":946,"Type a real phone number":947,"Type a town":948,"Type of leave":949,[u.oH]:950,"Type the amount":951,"Type the amount in N$.":952,"Type the amount received":953,"Type the amount that arrived":954,"Type the amount you paid":955,"Type the amount, or add items with prices":956,"Type the bank or proof reference":957,"Type the email you added to your account":958,"Type the name and a real phone number":959,"Type the name and choose the town":960,"Type the number of days":961,"Type the percentage.":962,"Type the reason.":963,"Type the reception phone number travellers can call":964,"Type the reference or receipt number":965,"Type the reference or transaction number on your proof of payment. It helps NamStay find your money quickly.":966,"Type the room name and the price per night":967,"Type the total received":968,[u.gB]:969,"Type your price":970,Unblock